Sure! Here’s the request you’d make to VirusTotal:

```json
{
  "method": "GET",
  "url": "https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/relationships/subdomains",
  "headers": {
    "x-apikey": "my_api"
  },
  "params": {
    "limit": 10,
    "continuation_cursor": "abc"
  }
}
```

This will return only the related objects’ IDs and any context attributes, limited to 10 results starting from the cursor `abc`.
